  "releaseNotes": "- Fix: `JsonValue.WriteTo` now always uses `CultureInfo.InvariantCulture` when serializing `Number` (decimal) values, preventing invalid JSON output (e.g. `1,5` instead of `1.5`) when called with a `TextWriter` configured with a non-English culture.\n- Perf: `JsonValue.WriteTo` no longer allocates an intermediate `System.String(' ', n)` per indentation level; spaces are written directly to the writer.",
